    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, it's not just one mistake. i've always been the one who had it all figured out. the \"perfect\" kid. now that the image is cracked, i feel like there's nothing left. everyone's memory of me is going to be this person i'm not anymore. it feels like it would be easier to just stay that version of myself forever instead of having to live as this... this letdown.",
